@obverse
1'. %sux [nam-dub-sar-ra am]a gu₃-de₂-ke₄-e-ne a-a u[m-me-a-ke₄-eš]
2'. ($___$) [ṭup-šar-r]u-tu₄ um-mu la-[i-ṭa-a]t a-bi u[m-ma-ni]
3'. %sux [nam-dub-sar-r]a nam in-da-ab-tu[ku-a] la-la-bi n[u-un-ge₄-ge₄]
4'. ($___$) [ṭup-šar-r]u-tu₄ ṣa-a-a-ha-a[t-ma] la-la-ša₂ ul i[š-šeb-bi]
5'. %sux [nam-dub-sar-r]a me-zu-gal₂ lu₂-su-bi nu-u[n-diri-ga]
