17'. %sux [gu₃-de₂ nam-mu-un-na]-an-šub-en sag₂-zu d[i-di-e-de₃]
18'. ($___$) [ah-ka t]a-nam-di-šim-ma ma-sik-ta-k[a iq-qab-bi]
