@colophon
13'. [E₂.G]AL {m}AN.ŠAR₂-DU₃-IBILA LUGAL ŠU₂ LUGAL {kur}AN.ŠAR₂{ki} ša {d}+AG u₃ {d}taš-me-tu₂ GEŠTU-MIN DAGAL-tu₂ iš-[ru-ku-uš]
14'. [i-hu-z]u IGI-MIN ZALAG₂-tu₄ ni-siq ṭup-šar-ru-ti ša ina LUGAL-MEŠ-ni a-lik [mah-ri-ia]
15'. [mam₂-ma šip-ru šu-a-tu] la i-hu-zu ne₂-me-eq {d}+AG ti-kip sa-an-tak-ki ma-la ba-aš₂-[mu]
16'. [ina ṭup-pa-a-ni aš₂-ṭur as-niq ab-r]e-e-ma a-na ta-mar-ti ši-ta-as-si-ia qe₂-reb [E₂.GAL-ia u₂-kin]